gLk(){return"Delete your Mirinu account"},
ga0B(){return"This page lets you delete your Mirinu account, even without the app. The server erases your account, the list of your devices and your encrypted library 7 days after the request; until then, you can cancel. Your library stays on your devices."},
ga0F(){return"Sign in with your account's method (Google or email address). Your library doesn't open on this page, and the sign-in ends after 24 hours."},
